        h2 §The Rust Standard Library @87,65,624,22
        text The Rust Standard Library is the foundation of portable Rust software, a set of minimal and battle-tested shared abstractions for the . It offers core types, like and , library-defined , , and , among . @87,99,624,60
        link "broader Rust ecosystem" https://crates.io @87,171,624,21
        link Vec<T> vec/struct.Vec.html @87,204,624,20
        link Option<T> option/enum.Option.html @87,236,624,20
