        h3 §Platform abstractions and I/O @87,3888,624,19
        text Besides basic data types, the standard library is largely concerned with abstracting over differences in common platforms, most notably Windows and Unix derivatives. @87,3919,624,40
        text Common types of I/O, including , , and , are defined in the , , and modules. @87,3971,624,21
